<title>PHILIPPINES: Swift Foods Q1 loss 44.761 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Swift Foods Q1 loss 44.761 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swift Foods Inc, the poultry firm of RFM Corp said on Tuesday it posted a net loss of 44.761 million pesos in the first quarter ended September, 1996.  </p>
<p>Net sales for the first quarter was at 1.632 billion pesos.</p>
<p>The first quarter loss is a deterioration from the 80.175 million-pesos net profit in the year-earlier quarter which had higher net sales of 1.651 billion pesos.</p>
<p>The company attributed the losses to an oversupply of chicken in the local market.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom (632) 841-8937</p>
</text>
